// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (already git-ignored — never commit that
// one) and fill in your real values for local builds.
//
// CI (Codemagic) writes Secrets.xcconfig itself before every build — see the
// "Write Secrets.xcconfig" step in codemagic.yaml — from a DERMIQ_API_KEY
// environment variable/secret group, if you've configured one there.

DERMIQ_API_KEY =
DERMIQ_BASE_URL = https://dev.dermiq.cloud
